{"title":"Career Roadmap · Radio Artist","role":"Radio Artist","summary":"A BA in Music (Vocal/Instrumental) provides a strong foundation for performance, musical interpretation, rhythm, voice/instrument technique and stage communication. It can support a career as a radio artist, particularly in music programming, performance, voice-based broadcasting and cultural programming.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"However, Radio Artist is a broad media-performance role rather than a single regulated profession. Modern radio careers increasingly overlap with RJ/Radio Presenter, Voice Artist, Music Programmer, Radio Producer, Podcast Host and Digital Audio Creator."},{"type":"p","text":"For a sustainable career, students should combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Music Performance","Voice/Presentation","Audio Production","Broadcasting","Digital Content"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Develop vocal/instrumental mastery, voice skills, broadcasting fundamentals and audio production"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Enter radio, community broadcasting, podcasting, audio production or digital music/content roles"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress to Radio Artist, RJ, Music Presenter, Radio Producer or senior audio-content professional"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Senior Radio Presenter, Music Director, Audio Producer, Programme Head, Podcast Creator or independent artist"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During the BA","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The ideal profile combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Music","Voice","Broadcasting","Audio Production","Communication","Digital Media"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Music Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"For vocal students:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vocal technique"},{