","Demo Reel + Performance Portfolio","Radio/Audio Entry Role","Radio Artist/RJ/Presenter","Senior Presenter/Producer"]},{"type":"p","text":"Students should not depend exclusively on traditional FM radio. A modern Radio Artist can build a career across FM/radio, community broadcasting, podcasts, digital audio platforms, voice-over, music programming, YouTube and independent audio production."},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest future-ready combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Music Performance","Radio Presentation","Audio Production","Podcasting","Social Media","AI Audio Tools."],"sep":"+"}]}]}